<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:35:30 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Supermicro 的调查证实首席执行官涉嫌 25 亿美元走私计划，而涉及联合创始人的刑事审判定于明年进行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/supermicro-investigation-ceo-nvidia-smuggling/</link><description>这家人工智能硬件制造商的董事会没有发现任何证据表明首席执行官梁朝伟对涉嫌芯片走私有任何了解，但悬而未决的审判可能会给这家陷入困境的公司带来更多的法律风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2223502567-e1787257194104.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:45:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/supermicro-investigation-ceo-nvidia-smuggling/</guid></item><item><title>由于气候变化威胁到以帕尔马干酪轮作为贷款抵押品的奶酪银行，意大利 47 亿美元的奶酪经济正感受到压力。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/italy-5-billion-cheese-economy-heat-wave-climate-change/</link><description>极端高温正在给存放帕尔马干酪轮子作为贷款抵押品的金库带来压力，经济学家表示，损失比金库还要大。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1252009317-e1786392064908.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:08:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/10/italy-5-billion-cheese-economy-heat-wave-climate-change/</guid></item><item><title>不仅仅是制造业：越南希望成为亚洲下一个文化强国</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/06/16/vietnam-culture-media-music-southeast-asia/</link><description>政府政策和草根创作者希望证明越南可以出口文化和消费品。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/VTR_6218-Enhanced-NR_v1-e1780668488608.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/06/16/vietnam-culture-media-music-southeast-asia/</guid></item><item><title>Airwallex从跨境支付扩展到自主金融——尽管总裁刘玉玲表示现在仍然“不是IPO的最佳时机”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/airwallex-fundraise-lucy-liu-ai-fintech-ipo-08-20-2026/</link><description>6月底，Airwallex在Addition领投的H轮融资中筹集了3.2亿美元，该跨境支付平台的估值为110亿美元&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Lucy-Liu.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/airwallex-fundraise-lucy-liu-ai-fintech-ipo-08-20-2026/</guid></item><item><title>独家：特朗普政府工作人员RTO指控的负责人表示，他在一堵空白墙前拍摄了一段视频，以避免在家工作的怀疑</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/opm-director-scott-kupor-record-video-blank-wall-work-from-home-return-to-office/</link><description>“我当时在卧室里，”OPM 总监 Scott Kupor 在本周的全体会议上说道。 “基本上，我试图在我的房子里找到一些无法辨认的东西。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2208340276-e1787257488233.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:31:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/opm-director-scott-kupor-record-video-blank-wall-work-from-home-return-to-office/</guid></item><item><title>价值 80 亿美元的网络安全收购帮助 ServiceNow 的股票摆脱了“Saaspocalypse”的担忧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/armis-wiz-8-billion-cybersecurity-acquisition-servicenow-saaspocalypse/</link><description>叶夫根尼·迪布罗夫 (Yevgeny Dibrov) 的 Armis 的交易是以色列有史以来第二大科技初创企业退出交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Avishag-Shaar-Yashuv-365.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 06:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/19/armis-wiz-8-billion-cybersecurity-acquisition-servicenow-saaspocalypse/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普没有注意到选民对数据中心的愤怒，他说“就业机会是巨大的，支付的钱、缴纳的税也是巨大的”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/donald-trump-data-center-midterm-races/</link><description>“这又是白宫显得充耳不闻的另一个维度，”德克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校德克萨斯政治项目的詹姆斯·汉森说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26231794808612-e1787253675880.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:49:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/donald-trump-data-center-midterm-races/</guid></item><item><title>作为“独特激励计划”的一部分，陆军部队为重新入伍的部队提供“特别 4 天通行证”来玩侠盗猎车手 VI</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/us-army-unit-four-day-pass-grand-theft-auto-vi/</link><description>至少有 20 名士兵报名参加了额外休息日——他们的资格与至少再服役两年有关。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26232587679655-e1787254511788.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:48:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/us-army-unit-four-day-pass-grand-theft-auto-vi/</guid></item><item><title>参议员要求 TikTok 给出关于“堕落”实验的答案</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/senate-tiktok-experiment/</link><description>根据一份机密内部文件，该公司对大约 1500 万用户（包括未成年人）隐瞒了算法保护措施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289507685-e1787252995984.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:12:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/senate-tiktok-experiment/</guid></item><item><title>贝森特成为几十年来最具干预主义色彩的财政部长</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/scott-bessent-treasury-interventionism/</link><description>扩大债券回购和日元购买标志着一种异常激进的做法，但赤字扩大可能会限制其有效性&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290658325-e1787252625714.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:07:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/20/scott-bessent-treasury-interventionism/</guid></item></channel></rss>